sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant SP as VRMSettingsPage
    participant Slider as Slider (QFluentWidgets)
    participant Spin as SpinBox
    participant VRM as VRMWidget
    participant Web as QWebEngineView
    participant JS as Three.js Scene
    participant FS as File System

    Note over User,FS: === 场景1: 滑块实时预览（高频路径） ===

    User->>Slider: 拖拽"手臂角度"滑块
    Slider->>SP: valueChanged(int_value)
    SP->>SP: _on_slider_changed(int_value, "arm_angle")
    SP->>SP: float_val = int_value / 100.0
    SP->>Spin: setValue(float_val)
    SP->>VRM: set_arm_angle(1.5)
    VRM->>Web: runJavaScript("window.setArmAngle(1.5)")
    Web->>JS: setArmAngle(1.5)
    JS->>JS: leftUpperArm.rotation.z = 1.5
    JS->>JS: rightUpperArm.rotation.z = -1.5
    Note over JS: animate() 60fps 自动渲染

    Note over User,FS: === 场景2: 保存配置 ===

    User->>SP: 点击"保存配置"
    SP->>SP: _save_config()
    SP->>SP: config = {arm_angle, model_scale, camera_distance, light_intensity}
    SP->>FS: 写入 config.yaml (vrm_display段)
    Note over FS: 使用 backend.config 或直接 YAML 操作
    SP->>FS: 写入 app/cache/vrm_display.json
    Note over FS: json.dump with indent=2
    SP->>SP: InfoBar.success("VRM 显示配置已保存")

    Note over User,FS: === 场景3: 页面初始化加载配置 ===

    SP->>VRM: load_model("default.vrm")
    Note over VRM: 异步加载，触发 model_loaded 信号
    SP->>FS: 读取 app/cache/vrm_display.json
    alt 缓存存在
        FS-->>SP: {"arm_angle": 1.0, "model_scale": 1.0, ...}
    else 缓存不存在
        SP->>FS: 读取 config.yaml → vrm_display
        FS-->>SP: {"arm_angle": 1.0, ...} (默认值)
    end
    SP->>SP: 设置4个 slider/spinbox 初始值
    VRM-->>SP: model_loaded 信号
    SP->>SP: _apply_all_to_preview()
    SP->>VRM: apply_display_config({arm_angle:1.0, ...})
    VRM->>Web: runJavaScript × 4 (逐项应用)

    Note over User,FS: === 场景4: 聊天页切换VRM联动 ===

    User->>SP: 在设置页修改参数并保存
    User->>SP: 切换到聊天页
    User->>SP: 点击 "VRM 3D" 按钮
    Note over SP: ChatPage.switch_model_type("vrm")
    SP->>SP: live2d_widget.hide()
    SP->>VRM: vrm_widget.show()
    SP->>SP: _apply_vrm_display_config()
    SP->>FS: 读取 app/cache/vrm_display.json
    FS-->>SP: {"arm_angle": 1.5, "camera_distance": 4.0, ...}
    SP->>VRM: apply_display_config(config)
    VRM->>Web: runJavaScript("window.setArmAngle(1.5)")
    VRM->>Web: runJavaScript("window.setModelScale(1.0)")
    VRM->>Web: runJavaScript("window.setCameraDistance(4.0)")
    VRM->>Web: runJavaScript("window.setLightIntensity(2.5)")
    Note over JS: VRM 模型以用户设定的参数渲染

    Note over User,FS: === 场景5: 重置默认 ===

    User->>SP: 点击"重置默认"
    SP->>SP: _reset_defaults()
    SP->>SP: 所有 slider → 默认值
    SP->>SP: _apply_all_to_preview()
    SP->>VRM: apply_display_config(defaults)
    SP->>SP: InfoBar.info("已恢复默认设置")
